DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
  "PGstandard.pl",
  "PGML.pl",
  "MathObjects.pl"
);

TEXT(beginproblem());
$ShowPartialCorrectAnswers = 1;

Context("Matrix");

$a = non_zero_random(-5,5,1);
$d = non_zero_random(-5,5,1);
$c = 1;
$b = $a*$d - 1;

$flip = random(0,1,1);
if ($flip) {
  $temp = $b;
  $b = $a;
  $a = $temp;
  $temp = $d;
  $d = $c;
  $c = $temp;
}
$flip = random(0,1,1);
if ($flip) {
  $temp = $c;
  $c = $a;
  $a = $temp;
  $temp = $d;
  $d = $b;
  $b = $temp;
}
## det will be 1 or -1 depending on flips
$det = $a*$d - $b*$c;


$P = Matrix([[$a,$b],[$c,$d]]);

$e11 = $a*$d*$det;
$point11 = Point('(1,1)');
$e12 = $d*$d*$det;
$point12 = Point('(2,2)');
$e21 = $a*$a*$det;
$point21 = Point('(3,3)');
$e22 = $a*$d*$det;
$point22 = Point('(4,4)');

$trace = $e11 + $e12 + $e21 + $e22;

BEGIN_PGML

Let [`T`] represent the linear operator on [`\operatorname{M}_{2 \times 2}(\mathbb{R})`]
defined by the formula [`T(A) = P^{-1} A P \text{,}`]
where [``` P = [$P] \text{.} ```]

Let [`\mathcal{S} = \lbrace E_{11},E_{12},E_{21},E_{22} \rbrace`] be the standard basis of [`\operatorname{M}_{2 \times 2}(\mathbb{R})`],
where [`E_{ij}`] is the [`2 \times 2`] matrix with a [`1`] in the [`(i,j)`] position and [`0`] in every other entry.


(a)
What is the coefficient on [`E_{11}`] if the image vector [`T(E_{11})`] is expressed as a linear combination of the [`\mathcal{S}`]-vectors?
[_________]{$e11}

What entry in the matrix [`[T]_{\mathcal{S}}`] does this result correspond to? (Use [`(i,j)`] notation.)
[_________]{$point11}

(b)
What is the coefficient on [`E_{12}`] if the image vector [`T(E_{12})`] is expressed as a linear combination of the [`\mathcal{S}`]-vectors?
[_________]{$e12}

What entry in the matrix [`[T]_{\mathcal{S}}`] does this result correspond to?
[_________]{$point12}

(c)
What is the coefficient on [`E_{21}`] if the image vector [`T(E_{21})`] is expressed as a linear combination of the [`\mathcal{S}`]-vectors?
[_________]{$e21}

What entry in the matrix [`[T]_{\mathcal{S}}`] does this result correspond to?
[_________]{$point21}

(d)
What is the coefficient on [`E_{22}`] if the image vector [`T(E_{22})`] is expressed as a linear combination of the [`\mathcal{S}`]-vectors?
[_________]{$e22}

What entry in the matrix [`[T]_{\mathcal{S}}`] does this result correspond to?
[_________]{$point22}

(e)
What is the value of [`\operatorname{trace} T`]?
[_________]{$trace}

END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
